      <h2 id="estimating-cluster-update-time_openshift-update-duration" class="group scroll-mt-20">How to estimate cluster update time<a href="#estimating-cluster-update-time_openshift-update-duration" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Historical update duration of similar clusters provides you the best estimate for the future cluster updates. If you do not have historical data, you can calculate an estimate of the update duration.</p>
