      <CodeBlock code={"Cluster update time = 60 + (6 x 5) = 90 minutes"} lang="text" />
      <p>In a scenario where you set <code>maxUnavailable</code> to <code>2</code> for the compute node MCP, then two compute nodes will update in parallel in each iteration. Therefore it takes total three iterations to update all the nodes.</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"Cluster update time = 60 + (3 x 5) = 75 minutes"} lang="text" />
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>The default setting for <code>maxUnavailable</code> is <code>1</code> for all the MCPs in OpenShift Container Platform. It is recommended that you do not change the <code>maxUnavailable</code> in the control plane MCP.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
